Package: ezx
Version: @VSN@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Sergii Polkovnikov <serge.polkovnikov@gmail.com>
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: libwxgtk3.2-1 | libwxgtk3.0-gtk3-0v5, alsa-utils
Description: ZX Spectrum 48K/128K emulator
 A ZX Spectrum 48K/128K emulator written in Erlang. Ships a
 self-contained OTP runtime; only the wxWidgets GTK3 runtime and the
 ALSA utils (aplay) are required from the system.
